    "## Task 1.2: Molecular Features that determine flash point [10 marks]\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Determine the number of carbon atoms in each molecule\n",
    "    > Hint: the SMILES representation includes either 'C' or 'c' for each carbon present\n",
