      "Discussion: \n",
      "We see that all of the features have a positive correlation with flashpoint, although weakly.\n",
      "As the number of carbons or branches increases the flashpoint increases slowly. \n",
      "The biggest correlation, however, with r = 0.440, is the number of heteroatoms in the molecule.\n",
